{"id":"b2e96ed477b7b031","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-encoding.md","title":"Natural Sequence and Binary Word Encodings","display":"df-encoding — Natural Sequence and Binary Word Encodings","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-encoding","aliases":["57-df-encoding"],"display":"df-encoding — Natural Sequence and Binary Word Encodings","depends_on":["[[57-df-composition-operator]]","[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-encoding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-encoding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-encoding — Natural Sequence and Binary Word Encodings"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为有限自然数列集；列按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\ldots,\\ell-1\">\\(0,\\ldots,\\ell-1\\)</span> 编号，空列为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\">\\(\\frown\\)</span> 为有限列连接；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a\\rangle^k\">\\(\\langle a\\rangle^k\\)</span> 为长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 且各分量等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 的列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_n,\\operatorname{unpack}_n\">\\(D_n,\\operatorname{unpack}_n\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}_n\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,u,i,j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(a,b,u,i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\mid u\">\\(d\\mid u\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\;(u=dq)\">\\(\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\;(u=dq)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sdecode}\">\\(\\operatorname{sdecode}\\)</span> 的递归调用严格减小自然数参数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(w\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pack}_n\">\\(\\operatorname{pack}_n\\)</span> 将自然数元组转为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_n\">\\(D_n\\)</span> 的输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle a,b\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq2^a(2b+1)-1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle a,b\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq2^a(2b+1)-1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{scode}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{scode}(\\langle a\\rangle\\frown w)\\coloneqq\\langle a,\\operatorname{scode}(w)\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}+1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{scode}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{scode}(\\langle a\\rangle\\frown w)\\coloneqq\\langle a,\\operatorname{scode}(w)\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}+1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{shd}(u)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;u=0,\\\\\\max\\{a\\le u:2^a\\mid u\\}&amp;u&gt;0,\\end{cases}\\qquad\n\\operatorname{stl}(u)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;u=0,\\\\(u/2^{\\operatorname{shd}(u)}-1)/2&amp;u&gt;0.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{shd}(u)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;u=0,\\\\\\max\\{a\\le u:2^a\\mid u\\}&amp;u&gt;0,\\end{cases}\\qquad\n\\operatorname{stl}(u)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;u=0,\\\\(u/2^{\\operatorname{shd}(u)}-1)/2&amp;u&gt;0.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u&gt;0\\to\\operatorname{stl}(u)&lt;u,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sdecode}(0)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sdecode}(u)\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{shd}(u)\\rangle\\frown\\operatorname{sdecode}(\\operatorname{stl}(u))\\quad(u&gt;0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u&gt;0\\to\\operatorname{stl}(u)&lt;u,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sdecode}(0)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sdecode}(u)\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{shd}(u)\\rangle\\frown\\operatorname{sdecode}(\\operatorname{stl}(u))\\quad(u&gt;0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{slen}(u)\\coloneqq|\\operatorname{sdecode}(u)|,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{stl}^{0}(u)\\coloneqq u,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{stl}^{i+1}(u)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{stl}(\\operatorname{stl}^{i}(u)),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sget}(u,i)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{shd}(\\operatorname{stl}^{i}(u)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{slen}(u)\\coloneqq|\\operatorname{sdecode}(u)|,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{stl}^{0}(u)\\coloneqq u,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{stl}^{i+1}(u)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{stl}(\\operatorname{stl}^{i}(u)),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sget}(u,i)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{shd}(\\operatorname{stl}^{i}(u)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{left}(u)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{shd}(u+1),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{right}(u)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{stl}(u+1),\\qquad\n\\langle\\operatorname{left}(u),\\operatorname{right}(u)\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}=u.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{left}(u)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{shd}(u+1),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{right}(u)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{stl}(u+1),\\qquad\n\\langle\\operatorname{left}(u),\\operatorname{right}(u)\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}=u.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{scode}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sdecode}=\\operatorname{scode}^{-1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{scode}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sdecode}=\\operatorname{scode}^{-1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle a\\rangle\\frown w)\\coloneqq\n\\langle1\\rangle^{a}\\frown\\langle0\\rangle\\frown\\operatorname{wordenc}(w),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{wordenc}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle a\\rangle\\frown w)\\coloneqq\n\\langle1\\rangle^{a}\\frown\\langle0\\rangle\\frown\\operatorname{wordenc}(w),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{wordenc}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Word}_n(\\vec x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\operatorname{unpack}_n(\\vec x))\\quad(\\vec x\\in D_n),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{WordCode}_n(\\vec x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{scode}(\\operatorname{Word}_n(\\vec x)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Word}_n(\\vec x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\operatorname{unpack}_n(\\vec x))\\quad(\\vec x\\in D_n),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{WordCode}_n(\\vec x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{scode}(\\operatorname{Word}_n(\\vec x)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{shd},\\operatorname{stl},\\operatorname{slen},\\operatorname{left},\\operatorname{right}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sget},\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{WordCode}_n\\in\\mathrm{PR}_n\\quad(n\\ge1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{shd},\\operatorname{stl},\\operatorname{slen},\\operatorname{left},\\operatorname{right}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sget},\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{WordCode}_n\\in\\mathrm{PR}_n\\quad(n\\ge1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条选择并完整声明同一可计算表示，供机器编号、历史码及 Church–Turing 接口共同使用。它不把 β 的原二参数定义替换成另一种编码。越界 sget 的值为 0，由 stl(0)=shd(0)=0 正式确定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"7463e44f61370c84","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-composition-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"7463e44f61370c84","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}$ 为有限自然数列集；列按 $0,\\ldots,\\ell-1$ 编号，空列为 $\\varepsilon$。$\\frown$ 为有限列连接；$\\langle a\\rangle^k$ 为长度 $k$ 且各分量等于 $a$ 的列。$D_n,\\operatorname{unpack}_n$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]，$\\mathrm{PR}_n$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。$a,b,u,i,j\\in\\mathbb N$；$d\\mid u$ 表示 $\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\;(u=dq)$。$\\operatorname{sdecode}$ 的递归调用严格减小自然数参数。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}$ 为有限自然数列集；列按 $0,\\ldots,\\ell-1$ 编号，空列为 $\\varepsilon$。$\\frown$ 为有限列连接；$\\langle a\\rangle^k$ 为长度 $k$ 且各分量等于 $a$ 的列。$D_n,\\operatorname{unpack}_n$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]，$\\mathrm{PR}_n$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。$a,b,u,i,j\\in\\mathbb N$；$d\\mid u$ 表示 $\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\;(u=dq)$。$\\operatorname{sdecode}$ 的递归调用严格减小自然数参数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\ldots,\\ell-1","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\frown","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle a\\rangle^k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"D_n,\\operatorname{unpack}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}_n","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,u,i,j\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"d\\mid u","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\;(u=dq)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sdecode}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pack}_n","display":false},{"tex":"D_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle a,b\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq2^a(2b+1)-1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{scode}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{scode}(\\langle a\\rangle\\frown w)\\coloneqq\\langle a,\\operatorname{scode}(w)\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}+1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{shd}(u)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&u=0,\\\\\\max\\{a\\le u:2^a\\mid u\\}&u>0,\\end{cases}\\qquad\n\\operatorname{stl}(u)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&u=0,\\\\(u/2^{\\operatorname{shd}(u)}-1)/2&u>0.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"u>0\\to\\operatorname{stl}(u)<u,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sdecode}(0)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sdecode}(u)\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{shd}(u)\\rangle\\frown\\operatorname{sdecode}(\\operatorname{stl}(u))\\quad(u>0).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{slen}(u)\\coloneqq|\\operatorname{sdecode}(u)|,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{stl}^{0}(u)\\coloneqq u,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{stl}^{i+1}(u)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{stl}(\\operatorname{stl}^{i}(u)),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sget}(u,i)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{shd}(\\operatorname{stl}^{i}(u)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{left}(u)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{shd}(u+1),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{right}(u)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{stl}(u+1),\\qquad\n\\langle\\operatorname{left}(u),\\operatorname{right}(u)\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}=u.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{scode}:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sdecode}=\\operatorname{scode}^{-1}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle a\\rangle\\frown w)\\coloneqq\n\\langle1\\rangle^{a}\\frown\\langle0\\rangle\\frown\\operatorname{wordenc}(w),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{wordenc}:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Word}_n(\\vec x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\operatorname{unpack}_n(\\vec x))\\quad(\\vec x\\in D_n),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{WordCode}_n(\\vec x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{scode}(\\operatorname{Word}_n(\\vec x)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{shd},\\operatorname{stl},\\operatorname{slen},\\operatorname{left},\\operatorname{right}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sget},\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{WordCode}_n\\in\\mathrm{PR}_n\\quad(n\\ge1).","display":true}],"bytes":3227,"backlinks":[{"id":"b9c9625457efede7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"自然数列编码、解码及分量函数取 [[57-df-encoding]]；$\\mathrm{Tape},\\mathrm{Conf},\\operatorname{Num}$ 取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]。$\\ell,i,j,s\\in\\mathbb N$，$z\\in\\mathbb Z$。下述列均按零起始编号；$\\operatorname{tenc}$ 是 $\\operatorname{tdec}$ 的逆函数，唯一性由同一断言中的双射性质保证，不作任意选择。$\\operatorname{cdec},\\operatorname{Last},U$ 在非法码上也给定值。"},{"id":"446d13f76de9da28","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,m\\ge1$，$f\\in\\mathcal P_n$。数值函数图及 $\\operatorname{pack}_n,\\operatorname{unpack}_n$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]；$\\mathrm{PartRec}_n,\\mathrm{Rec}_n$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function-class]]，$\\mathrm{PR}_n$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。编号、输入和输出严格取 [[57-df-program-numbering]]、[[57-df-encoding]]、[[57-df-machine-coding]]；$T_n$ 取 [[57-df-t-predicate]]；相对可计算性取 [[57-df-effective-procedure]]。$\\Psi_e^{(n)}$ 为下式定义的机器部分函数图，不使用尚未定义的 φₑ。$\\chi_{T_n}$ 是平坦输入 $(e,x_1,\\ldots,x_n,s)$ 上的总特征函数。"},{"id":"6cf31091f58bf0b5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ 取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]，数值串及二元配对编码取 [[57-df-encoding]]。指令列码按键 $\\langle q,a\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}$ 严格递增排序；指令的五个字段依次为状态、读符号、下一状态、写符号、移动量加一。$e,u,i,j\\in\\mathbb N$；所有自然数都作为程序索引，非法表码映射到没有转移、不会停机的空表。"},{"id":"c98bc9b1a979b2fd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X$ 为集合，$s\\in X^m,t\\in X^n,a\\in X$，列按零起始索引。数码 $u,v,b\\in\\mathbb N$ 及 $\\operatorname{scode},\\operatorname{sdecode}$ 取 [[57-df-encoding]]；$\\mathrm{PR}_2$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。一般论域上的列与其自然数码是不同类型。"},{"id":"5ab2dcd23faf2b6d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\ge1$，$e,s\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x\\in D_n$。$D_n$ 及打包约定取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]；$M_e$ 取 [[57-df-program-numbering]]；$\\operatorname{Word}_n$ 取 [[57-df-encoding]]；$\\operatorname{HistCode},\\operatorname{cdec},U$ 取 [[57-df-machine-coding]]；$\\operatorname{Init},\\operatorname{Step},\\operatorname{HaltConf}$ 取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]。$T_n(e,\\vec x,s)$ 使用该固定编号和该固定输入表示。"},{"id":"20d4e2ccede99498","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"背景为 ZFC。$\\Gamma=\\{0,1,2\\}$，其中 $2$ 是空白；带位置为 $\\mathbb Z$，状态为 $\\mathbb N$，初态 $0$、停机态 $1$，移动量为 $-1,0,1$。$\\mathrm{Partial}$ 取 [[57-df-partial-function]]；有限列及其长度使用 [[57-df-encoding]]。机器是有限转移函数图 $M$，带是只记录非空白格的有限函数图 $t$。未列转移及停机状态在 Step 下保持原配置；只有状态 1 算停机。$q\\in\\mathbb N,p\\in\\mathbb Z,b\\in\\Gamma$；$w,v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}$，$j\\in\\mathbb N$。"},{"id":"68e2d5e250a907ad","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\ge1$，$f\\in\\mathcal P_k$；$D_k$、数值元组及打包映射取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]。输入和输出使用 [[57-df-encoding]] 的同一 $\\operatorname{wordenc},\\operatorname{Word}_k$ 表示。$\\mathrm{Effective}_{\\iota_X,\\iota_Y}$ 取 [[57-df-effective-procedure]] 的机器谓词，底层机器取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]；$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function]]。本环境固定 $X=D_k,Y=\\mathbb N,\\iota_X=\\operatorname{in}_k,\\iota_Y=\\operatorname{out}$。正规形对应取 [[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closure]]\n[[57-df-halt-notation]]\n[[57-df-machine-coding]]\n[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]\n[[57-df-multiplication-function]]\n[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]\n[[57-df-primrec-operator]]\n[[57-df-program-numbering]]\n[[57-df-projection-function]]\n[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]\n[[57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]\n[[57-df-sequence-concatenation]]\n[[57-df-successor-function]]\n[[57-df-t-predicate]]\n[[57-df-turing-machine]]\n[[57-df-zero-function]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-219","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closure]]\n[[57-df-halt-notation]]\n[[57-df-machine-coding]]\n[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]\n[[57-df-multiplication-function]]\n[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]\n[[57-df-primrec-operator]]\n[[57-df-program-numbering]]\n[[57-df-projection-function]]\n[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]\n[[57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]\n[[57-df-sequence-concatenation]]\n[[57-df-successor-function]]\n[[57-df-t-predicate]]\n[[57-df-turing-machine]]\n[[57-df-zero-function]]"}],"outgoing":["7463e44f61370c84","6198f000bea16af4"]}